omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rRuo5lzjp4wQ7kNvwGevH1t&_nc_oc=Adrf1n5XR2xM9H7S7RK9VykvsVMliKyUH253JIHO5bltZOF6FAwD0cGmW5V_frjV_lc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQeyaQfNAiDZSGVr6k_zOc0kccIgxqYWKFP8cocJczlnA&oe=6AE9FC34"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e33tnTHe8RoQ7kNvwEAvou4&_nc_oc=AdqjUCdoq_GntyS9DKFqgrRHIB9L2OaCCaWzQnbZ_nD9cnTWU412cZ59URIapxUbKa8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQxp63Gf9Sq-W2MNsMjNGgQSsqKHRXCq15_Fktq0yjclw&oe=6AE9FD96"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZJZHCQO_-doQ7kNvwFE67FA&_nc_oc=AdrdLaOO61rt3iKi24Vm0xtl2JTCoR7Gtm5_0Kh9q0HUHeF8WFBHO5c-90Tl_KKzcBk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRc-zako4a-LqOCN0OVXkdl3Ww4BytvNi-vJMP7srkWyQ&oe=6AEA12B7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://